<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Frequently Asked Questions - ChapterChase</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #3498db;
            --secondary-color: #2c3e50;
            --accent-color: #e74c3c;
            --background-color: #f4f4f4;
            --text-color: #333;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
        }
        
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-color);
            background-color: var(--background-color);
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        header {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        main {
            padding: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .faq-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .faq-item {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .faq-question {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background-color: var(--secondary-color);
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .faq-question:hover {
            background-color: #34495e;
        }
        
        .faq-question::after {
            content: '+';
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .faq-answer {
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .faq-item.active .faq-question {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
        }
        
        .faq-item.active .faq-question::after {
            transform: rotate(45deg);
        }
        
        .faq-item.active .faq-answer {
            max-height: 300px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .contact-support {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        
        .contact-support h2 {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }
        
        .button:hover {
            background-color: #c0392b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
            <p>Find quick answers to common questions about ChapterChase</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <section class="faq-list">
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">How do I place an order?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>To place an order, simply browse our catalog, add items to your cart, and proceed to checkout. You'll need to provide shipping information and payment details to complete your purchase.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">What payment methods do you accept?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We accept major credit cards (Visa, MasterCard, American Express), PayPal, and ChapterChase gift cards. For some regions, we also offer cash on delivery.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">How long does shipping take?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Shipping times vary depending on your location and chosen shipping method. Standard shipping typically takes 3-7 business days, while express shipping can deliver within 1-3 business days.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">What is your return policy?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>We offer a 30-day return policy for most items. Books must be in their original condition to be eligible for a full refund. Please note that shipping costs for returns are the responsibility of the customer unless the return is due to our error.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">Do you offer international shipping?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Yes, we ship to many countries worldwide. International shipping rates and delivery times vary by location. You can see specific shipping options and costs during the checkout process.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <div class="faq-question">How can I track my order?</div>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    <p>Once your order ships, you'll receive a shipping confirmation email with a tracking number. You can use this number on our website or the carrier's site to track your package's progress.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <div class="contact-support">
            <h2>Still have questions?</h2>
            <p>Our support team is here to help you with any additional questions or concerns.</p>
            <a href="#" class="button">Contact Support</a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(question => {
            question.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const item = question.parentNode;
                item.classList.toggle('active');
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>